%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a function-based shading with a sampled function from a
% reusable stream. The samples arrive in the job as hexadecimal text,
% read through the pre-filter into a positionable stream that the type
% 0 function names as its DataSource; the function is read from the
% stream's start whatever was read before, and the shading paints the
% same four-corner blend as its string-sourced twin, this time under a
% clip narrower than its domain rectangle.
%%BeginData: 2 ASCII Lines
/S currentfile << /Filter /ASCIIHexDecode >> /ReusableStreamDecode filter
ff0000 00ff00 0000ff ffff00>
%%EndData
def
S 3 setfileposition
gsave
150 300 100 100 rectclip
<< /ShadingType 1 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /Domain [0 1 0 1] /Matrix [200 0 0 100 100 300]
   /Function << /FunctionType 0 /Domain [0 1 0 1] /Range [0 1 0 1 0 1]
     /Size [2 2] /BitsPerSample 8 /DataSource S >> >> shfill
grestore
showpage
